## Key Advantage Over Expo

> Open terminal ? `npm run dev` ? app is live in your browser in under 10 seconds. No phone, no emulator, no QR codes. When ready to share, deploy to Vercel in one command: `npx vercel`.


### PHASE 1 -upgrade
I would actually rethink the model slightly.

The user should **not think in terms of database categories** ("Goal", "Routine", "Purchase"). They think in terms of:

> "What kind of thing am I trying to remember?"

For a SinceTimer app, the entire product revolves around **life events**.

---

# 1. Areas (High-level Domains)

Current:

```
Home | Work | Personal | Health
```

I'd expand to:

| Area            | Examples                           |
| --------------- | ---------------------------------- |
| 🏠 Home         | Curtains, AC service, Water filter |
| 👤 Personal     | Passport renewal, Haircut          |
| ❤️ Health       | Checkups, Vaccines, Dental         |
| 💼 Work         | Certifications, Reviews            |
| 🚗 Vehicle      | Insurance, Service                 |
| 💰 Finance      | FD maturity, SIP review            |
| 🏡 Property     | Tax, Maintenance                   |
| 🐶 Pets         | Vaccines, Grooming                 |
| 👨‍👩‍👧 Family | Parents checkup, School fees       |
| 📦 Digital      | Domain renewal, Cloud subscription |

Areas are mostly for filtering.

---

# 2. Categories (Core Object Types)

Instead of:

```
Goal
Routine
Task
Purchase
Subscription
```

I would use:

| Category         | Purpose                     |
| ---------------- | --------------------------- |
| 🔄 Routine       | Repeating activities        |
| 📅 Appointment   | One-off scheduled events    |
| 💳 Subscription  | Recurring payments          |
| 📜 Renewal       | Documents/licenses          |
| 🛠 Maintenance   | Physical assets             |
| 🎯 Goal          | Long-term targets           |
| 🛒 Purchase      | Warranty/ownership tracking |
| 💉 Health Record | Medical events              |
| 📝 Custom        | User-defined                |

