# 8. The real data model underneath

Rather than many tables:

```
Event
├── title
├── area
├── category
├── dates{}
├── metadata{}
├── history[]
├── attachments[]
```

Example:

```json
{
  "title": "Curtains",
  "area": "Home",
  "category": "Routine",
  "dates": {
    "last_done": "2026-06-06",
    "next_due": "2026-08-06"
  },
  "metadata": {
    "interval_days": 60
  }
}
```

This gives you enormous flexibility without changing the database schema.

